Package: websocket
Title: Placeholder for the jmv2gg Browser Report Preview (Not the 'websocket' Package)
Version: 1.2.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Gilad", "Feldman", email = "giladfel@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: NOT the CRAN 'websocket' package, which has no WebR build. jmv's
    contingency tables call 'vcdExtra', whose imports reach 'chromote', which
    imports 'websocket'; without it 'vcdExtra' cannot load in WebR. This
    placeholder lets that chain load in the jmv2gg browser report preview only.
    It opens no connections: WebSocket$new() stops with an explanatory error.
    The version satisfies 'chromote' (websocket >= 1.2.0); '.9000' marks it as
    not a release of the real package.
